---
export const prerender = true;
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy (GDPR) | Jaromir Konupka"
  description="Privacy policy and GDPR information for the contact form on konupka.dev."
>
  <div class="page-header">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="subtitle">How your personal data is handled when you use the contact form.</p>
  </div>

  <section class="gdpr-section">
    <div class="gdpr-card">

      <div class="gdpr-block">
        <h2>1. Data Controller</h2>
        <p>
          The controller of your personal data is:<br />
          <strong>Jaromír Konůpka</strong><br />
          Email: <a href="mailto:jaromir@konupka.dev">jaromir@konupka.dev</a>
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="gdpr-block">
        <h2>2. What Data Is Collected</h2>
        <p>When you submit the contact form on this website, the following personal data is collected:</p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Name</strong> — to address you personally in my reply.</li>
          <li><strong>Email address</strong> — to respond to your enquiry.</li>
          <li><strong>Message content</strong> — the text of your enquiry.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>No additional data (e.g. IP address, cookies) is collected through the contact form itself.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="gdpr-block">
        <h2>3. Purpose and Legal Basis</h2>
        <p>
          Your data is processed solely to respond to your enquiry. The legal basis for this processing
          is your <strong>consent</strong> (Article 6(1)(a) GDPR), which you give by ticking the consent
          checkbox before submitting the form.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="gdpr-block">
        <h2>4. Data Retention</h2>
        <p>
          Your data is retained only as long as necessary to handle your enquiry and any follow-up
          communication. Once the matter is resolved, your data will be deleted within
          <strong>90 days</strong>, unless a longer retention period is required by law.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="gdpr-block">
        <h2>5. Third-Party Processors</h2>
        <p>
          Form submissions are processed by <strong>Netlify, Inc.</strong> (form hosting provider).
          Netlify may temporarily store submitted data on its servers. Netlify is GDPR-compliant and
          processes data under a Data Processing Agreement. For more information, see the
          <a href="https://www.netlify.com/privacy/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Netlify Privacy Policy</a>.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="gdpr-block">
        <h2>6. Your Rights</h2>
        <p>Under the GDPR you have the following rights regarding your personal data:</p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Right of access</strong> — request a copy of the data held about you.</li>
          <li><strong>Right to rectification</strong> — request correction of inaccurate data.</li>
          <li><strong>Right to erasure</strong> — request deletion of your data ("right to be forgotten").</li>
          <li><strong>Right to restriction</strong> — request that processing of your data be limited.</li>
          <li><strong>Right to object</strong> — object to processing based on legitimate interests.</li>
          <li><strong>Right to withdraw consent</strong> — withdraw your consent at any time without affecting the lawfulness of prior processing.</li>
          <li><strong>Right to lodge a complaint</strong> — file a complaint with the supervisory authority in your country of residence.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          To exercise any of these rights, contact me at
          <a href="mailto:jaromir@konupka.dev">jaromir@konupka.dev</a>.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="gdpr-block">
        <h2>7. Changes to This Policy</h2>
        <p>
          This policy may be updated from time to time. The date of the last revision is shown below.
          Continued use of the contact form after any changes constitutes acceptance of the updated policy.
        </p>
        <p class="last-updated">Last updated: <time datetime="2026-03-18">18 March 2026</time></p>
      </div>

      <div class="back-link-wrap">
        <a href="/contact/" class="back-link">← Back to Contact</a>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .page-header {
    padding: 2rem 0 1rem;
    animation: fadeIn 0.6s ease-out;
  }

  .page-header h1 {
    margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
  }

  .subtitle {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: var(--color-secondary);
    margin: 0;
  }

  .gdpr-section {
    padding-bottom: 3rem;
    animation: fadeIn 0.6s ease-out;
  }

  /* override global section styles */
  .gdpr-section {
    background: none;
    border-radius: 0;
    padding-top: 0;
    margin: 0;
    box-shadow: none;
    border: none;
    backdrop-filter: none;
    transform: none;
  }

  .gdpr-section:hover {
    transform: none;
    box-shadow: none;
  }

  .gdpr-card {
    background: var(--surface-color);
    border-radius: 24px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg);
    padding: 2.5rem;
    max-width: 780px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 2rem;
  }

  .gdpr-block h2 {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin: 0 0 0.75rem;
    color: var(--color);
  }

  .gdpr-block p,
  .gdpr-block ul {
    font-size: 0.975rem;
    line-height: 1.75;
    color: var(--color-secondary);
    margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
  }

  .gdpr-block ul {
    padding-left: 1.4rem;
  }

  .gdpr-block li {
    margin-bottom: 0.35rem;
  }

  .gdpr-block a {
    color: var(--primary-color);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 2px;
  }

  .gdpr-block a:hover {
    color: var(--primary-dark);
  }

  .last-updated {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--color-secondary);
    opacity: 0.7;
  }

  .back-link-wrap {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color);
    padding-top: 1.5rem;
  }

  .back-link {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.4rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--primary-color);
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: color 0.2s ease;
  }

  .back-link:hover {
    color: var(--primary-dark);
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .gdpr-card {
      padding: 1.75rem 1.25rem;
    }
  }
</style>
